  "purpose": "the entries of m3_run_v1_10 (rows 2, 3 and 5): Set A (P2-14 window moments), Set C (P2-3 odd route) and the double-trick entries W1, W2 of row 5 (route D); each entry, graph and convention copied verbatim from the source list. UL3 and UR3 (F 20) are not here: their series at nv 20 need exponents of about 8 to 9, beyond int64 packing in one base (9^20, 10^20 > 2^63), so they wait for R2 or a mixed-radix kernel (pk03, 2026-11-08).",
